    "body_html": "<p data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"236\"><strong>[The Perfect Companion for Young Creative Makers] </strong>SUNLU 250g filament spool, giving young inventors plenty of material to experiment, explore ideas, and create freely—turning imagination into reality.</p>\n<p data-start=\"421\" data-end=\"458\"><strong>[Space-Saving &amp; Easy to Store] </strong>Each mini spool is only <strong data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"527\">one-quarter the size of a standard spool</strong>, keeping workspaces and storage areas neat, organized, and efficient—ideal for homes and classrooms.</p>\n<p data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"676\"><strong>[Creative Color Freedom, No Waste] </strong>Enjoy a versatile multi-color selection for small models and creative projects. Easily switch colors without the waste of large spools that often go unfinished.</p>\n<p data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"893\"><strong>[Stable Compatibility for Smooth Printing] </strong>With a precisely controlled diameter of <strong data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"952\">1.75mm ±0.02mm</strong>, the filament ensures smooth feeding and consistent extrusion for reliable printing results.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1091\"><strong>[Safe, Non-Toxic &amp; Eco-Friendly] </strong>Made from <strong data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1127\">plant-based materials</strong>, this filament emits minimal odor during printing and is <strong data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1207\">non-toxic and safe</strong> for home and classroom use. The <strong data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1273\">low shrinkage rate (0.1–0.3%)</strong> helps reduce warping and deformation, ensuring accurate dimensions. Eco-friendly manufacturing further minimizes environmental impact.</p>",
